      <img id="slide-img-2" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470071459604-3b5ec3a7fe05?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition duration-300 absolute inset-0 opacity-0" alt="Mountains" />
